@host = http://localhost:5226

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Login (the HTTP client retains the authentication cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "User1",
  "password": "TechnicalChallengePromtior"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Obtain an antiforgery token before state-changing requests
# @name csrf
GET {{host}}/api/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token); %}

### List all rooms
GET {{host}}/api/rooms

### List available rooms
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/available?startUtc=2026-09-01T13:00:00Z&endUtc=2026-09-01T14:00:00Z&attendees=4

### View room schedule
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/A/schedule?startUtc=2026-09-01T12:00:00Z&endUtc=2026-09-01T18:00:00Z

### Create a booking
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "roomCode": "A",
  "startUtc": "2026-09-01T13:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2026-09-01T14:00:00Z",
  "title": "Interview with John Doe",
  "attendees": 4
}

### List current user's upcoming bookings
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/mine

### Cancel a booking (replace the id)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
